5. Considering that the offences alleged are triable by the Court of the learned Magistrate;
co-accused Kamaljit Kaur @ Mand and Gagangian Deep Singh @ Mand have already been granted anticipatory bail by this Court; co-accused Ranjit Kaur has been released on regular bail by this Court and another co-accused Sukhbir Singh has also been granted regular bail by the Court below;
and also further taking note of the age of the petitioner as well as the period of custody suffered by him, this Court is of the opinion that no useful purpose would be served by keeping the petitioner behind bars for an indefinite period.
